PyObject_GetBuffer/PyBuffer_Release looks heavy in terms of performance just to avoid the race condition.

I suggest to only increment/decrement `ob_exports`. Something like:

```c
    Py_BEGIN_CRITICAL_SECTION(self);
    self->ob_exports++;
    Py_END_CRITICAL_SECTION();

    res = op(PyByteArray_AS_STRING(self), Py_SIZE(self), sub, start, end);

    Py_BEGIN_CRITICAL_SECTION(self);
    self->ob_exports--;
    assert(self->ob_exports >= 0);
    Py_END_CRITICAL_SECTION();

    return res;
```

